---
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-12"
  title="Rules of engagement"
  summary="Clear boundaries for respectful, private conversations."
  related={[
    { href: '/community-guidelines', label: 'Community guidelines' },
    { href: '/privacy', label: 'Privacy policy' },
    { href: '/recording-policy', label: 'Recording & AI safety' },
  ]}
>
  <h2>Be respectful</h2>
  <p>Speak to every person with dignity. Harassment, threats, hateful conduct, sexual pressure and abusive language are not allowed.</p>

  <h2>Keep personal contact details private</h2>
  <p>Do not ask for or share phone numbers, email addresses, social handles, home addresses or off-platform meeting details during a marketplace call.</p>

  <h2>Respect consent and boundaries</h2>
  <p>Either person may end a call at any time. A host may decline a call, and a caller may choose not to continue. Do not pressure someone to stay.</p>

  <h2>Use the service for conversation</h2>
  <p>Marketplace calls are conversations, not medical, legal, financial or emergency services. Do not promise diagnoses, guaranteed outcomes or emergency response.</p>

  <h2>Protect call privacy</h2>
  <p>Do not record or redistribute a call. Follow the published recording and AI-safety policy, and report conduct that breaks these rules.</p>

  <h2>Reviews must be genuine</h2>
  <p>Only review a call you genuinely joined. Describe your own experience without contact details, private information or abuse.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
